  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A proton enters a region where electric and magnetic fields are perpendicular to each other. The initial velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> of the proton is perpendicular to both fields. The path of the proton is not deflected in the fields.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p><br/>The proton is replaced by an alpha particle that is also not deflected by the fields. What is the velocity of the alpha particle?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2v\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4v\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
